      "message": "I imagine this call can fail, e.g. if the driver fails to create a VkRenderPass. If so we need to check the return value here before using it. I\u0027m not sure what the best fallback here is since we are pretty late in the game, but at least the calling code will need to know not to add any more commands if beingRenderPass failed.\n\nI kind of feel like we should just abort the entire insertion of the Recording, but that makes it awkward if we already have recording some commands into the command buffer.",
